    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey my 14 month old has had diarrhea since yesterday and he's just super sleepy and won't really play. he also hasn't had a wet diaper in like 8 hours now... can i just give him some diluted apple juice to get some fluids in him or do i need to go to the er??",
